        "usage": """Usage
  rondo                 Open or attach to this project's session
                        Show the action menu from an open shell tab
  rondo menu            Open the test, review, knowledge, and settings menu
  rondo status          Show repository state and the recommended next action
  rondo audience [mode] Choose explanation level (default|nondev|guided)
  rondo add [agent]     Add a pane to the current session
  rondo send <agent> <message>
                        Type and submit a message in an agent pane
  rondo handoff [note]  Create a Git-portable handoff file
  rondo resume [agent]  Resume it in Claude or Codex
  rondo task "<goal>" [--accept condition] [--avoid condition]
                        Record intent and acceptance criteria
  rondo learn memory "<fact>"
                        Propose repository memory for human approval
  rondo learn skill <name> "<procedure>"
                        Propose a reusable procedure for human approval
  rondo learn [pending|show|approve|reject|remove] [ID]
                        Review, approve, or remove project knowledge
  rondo recall [query|--id ID]
                        Search approved memory, procedures, and work history
  rondo note "<summary>" [--ref reference]
                        Record a high-signal searchable work summary
  rondo history [query|--sessions]
                        Search the repository work journal and agent sessions
  rondo schedule [command]
                        Create and manage human-approved scheduled work
  rondo proof [--reviewer codex] [--no-checks]
                        Build evidence, risk, and human decisions
  rondo git [command]   Connect Git and configure PR/reviewer policy
  rondo code-review [agent|all]
                        Open independent read-only agent reviews
  rondo test [profile] [--from implementer] [--tester verifier]
                        Run red, blue, reliability, and security tests in fresh sessions
  rondo pr [title]      Push this branch and create a policy-aware PR
  rondo review [--budget 2m]
                        Show only what fits the review budget
  rondo lens [URL]      Click a UI element and send its focused context
  rondo race "<task>" [--agents list] [--yes]
                        Run one task independently in several worktrees
  rondo race --status|--send|--abort
                        Inspect, resend, or discard the active race
  rondo diff [agent]    Compare race results
  rondo take <agent>    Apply one race result
  rondo snap [label]    Snapshot the current working tree
  rondo undo [ID|--steps N] [--yes]
                        Restore a working-tree snapshot
  rondo undo --list     List restorable snapshot IDs
  rondo kill [session]  Stop this project's or a named Rondo session
  rondo clean           Remove local caches for deleted repositories
  rondo language        Switch between English and Korean
  rondo relay [mode]    Show or change Claude → Codex relay mode
  rondo continue        Continue a prepared relay in Codex
  rondo doctor [--deep] Diagnose install and config (--deep probes vendor data)
  rondo update [--check|--version X] [--yes]
                        Check or install a verified release
  rondo rollback [--yes]
                        Restore the previously installed release
  rondo uninstall [--purge] [--yes]
                        Remove Rondo (keeps settings and cache by default)
  rondo support-bundle [path]
                        Create a diagnostic bundle without raw content
  rondo -l              List running sessions

Inside a session
  Ctrl+p then x         Close the current pane
  Ctrl+p + arrow        Move between panes
  Ctrl+t + arrow        Move between tabs (agents | shell)
  Ctrl+o then d         Detach (the session keeps running)
